# Styling and Design System Rules

## 🎨 Design System Architecture

### Theme Structure
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Use theme from styles/theme.ts
import { DefaultTheme } from 'styled-components';

const theme: DefaultTheme = {
  colors: {
    black: '#0A0A0A',
    grey001: '#141415',
    point1: '#6963FF',
    point2: '#53FFCB',
    white: '#FFFFFF',
  },
  typography: {
    mobile: { /* mobile typography */ },
    tablet: { /* tablet typography */ },
    desktop: { /* desktop typography */ },
  },
  media: { /* responsive breakpoints */ },
};
```

### MUST FOLLOW Rules
✅ **ALWAYS** use styled-components for styling
✅ **ALWAYS** use theme colors and typography
✅ **ALWAYS** implement responsive design with theme.media
✅ **ALWAYS** use rem units (62.5% base font size)
✅ **ALWAYS** create separate style files for components
✅ **ALWAYS** use semantic color names from theme
✅ **ALWAYS** implement proper hover and focus states

### NEVER DO Rules
❌ **NEVER** use inline styles or CSS classes
❌ **NEVER** hardcode colors or font sizes
❌ **NEVER** use px units (use rem)
❌ **NEVER** forget responsive design
❌ **NEVER** use !important in styled-components
❌ **NEVER** create styles without theme integration

### Responsive Design Rules
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Responsive styling
const Container = styled.div`
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 2rem;
  
  ${({ theme }) => theme.media.mobile`
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1rem;
  `}
  
  ${({ theme }) => theme.media.tablet`
    padding: 1.5rem;
  `}
  
  ${({ theme }) => theme.media.desktop`
    padding: 2rem;
  `}
`;

// ❌ WRONG - Hardcoded responsive design
const Container = styled.div`
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 20px;
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 10px;
  }
`;
```

### Typography Usage
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Using theme typography
const Title = styled.h1`
  ${({ theme }) => theme.typography.desktop.title}
  color: ${({ theme }) => theme.colors.black};
  
  ${({ theme }) => theme.media.mobile`
    ${theme.typography.mobile.title}
  `}
`;

// ❌ WRONG - Hardcoded typography
const Title = styled.h1`
  font-family: Area;
  font-size: 4rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: normal;
`;
```

### Color Usage
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Using theme colors
const Button = styled.button`
  background-color: ${({ theme }) => theme.colors.point1};
  color: ${({ theme }) => theme.colors.white};
  
  &:hover {
    background-color: ${({ theme }) => theme.colors.point2};
  }
`;

// ❌ WRONG - Hardcoded colors
const Button = styled.button`
  background-color: #6963FF;
  color: #FFFFFF;
`;
```

### Breakpoint System
```typescript
const BREAKPOINT = {
  MOBILE: 360,    // 0-767px
  TABLET: 768,    // 768-1439px
  DESKTOP: 1440,  // 1440-1919px
  WIDE: 1920      // 1920px+
};
```

